      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Video + rigged model -> animated GLB.\nSelect your video and skinned FBX/GLB in the two Load nodes. The model, DINOv2-Large, T5-base, and a ComfyUI background removal model are installed once.\nSet forward_axis to the direction the character faces. Embedded skeletal animation improves the reference; a static rig uses its rest pose.\nComfyUI Remove Background supplies the mask. Preview the animation and use Save 3D to write its GLB."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
